Only the queries, the shapes and the checklists are derived. No expected value
is, and no SQL text of that project's own dialects is:
calcite-dotnet treats Apache Calcite's enumerable engine as its specification and
reproduces Calcite's defects deliberately, whereas Chalk's specification is SQL
and every answer here is derived from Chalk's own reference executor and from
DuckDB.
